Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.74,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:38.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:43.67,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.12,0:02:46.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:50.17,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:55.89,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.89,0:03:02.04,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:06.54,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.21,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.98,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:20.35,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.35,0:03:25.60,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:29.42,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.92,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Da lâmina erguida aos céus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:39.37,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.74,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.74,0:02:38.96,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.96,0:02:43.67,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur0.75}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.12,0:02:46.96,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.96,0:02:50.17,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.17,0:02:55.89,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.89,0:03:02.04,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur0.75}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.27,0:03:06.54,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.21,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur0.75}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.98,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur0.75}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.74,0:03:20.35,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.35,0:03:25.60,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur0.75}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.75,0:03:29.42,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur0.75}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.92,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}Da lâmina erguida aos céus
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.92,0:03:39.37,Opening1-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur0.75}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.46,0:22:10.08,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\t(0,428,1,\c&H96B9F7&)\blur0.75}Se o meu destino for virar cinzas e ossos
